flowchart TD
    newTask[New task or issue] --> triage[Triage agent runs]
    triage --> outcome{Triage outcome}

    outcome -->|Automatable| implementation[Implementation agent runs]
    outcome -->|Needs specs due to scope or ambiguity| specs[Spec agent runs]
    specs --> specReview[Human reviews specs]
    specReview -->|Needs revision| specs
    specReview -->|Approved| implementation
    outcome -->|Needs human clarification| clarification[Human provides input]
    clarification -->|Clarification provided| triage
    outcome -->|Park for now| parked[Park issue for now]

    implementation --> codeReview[Code review agent runs]
    codeReview --> verification[Verification agent runs]
    verification --> humanReview[Human reviews code and verification output]
    humanReview --> ready{Ready to ship?}
    ready -->|Not ready| implementation
    ready -->|Approved| cicd[CI/CD]

    cicd --> ship[Ship it]
    ship --> monitoring[Monitoring agent runs]
    monitoring --> issueDetected{Issue detected?}
    issueDetected -->|Yes| createIssue[Create issue]
    createIssue --> factoryLoop[Factory loop continues]
    factoryLoop --> newTask
    issueDetected -->|No| continueMonitoring[Continue monitoring]
    continueMonitoring --> monitoring
